      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Host SPI commands (mode 0, MSB first, one command per CS_N-low frame)\n\u2022 WRITE_IMEM  addr, hi, lo  (rejected while running \u2192 ERROR)\n\u2022 READ_IMEM  addr  \u2192  hi, lo\n\u2022 WRITE_REG  reg, value\n\u2022 READ_REG  reg  \u2192  value\n\u2022 PUSH_TX  byte \u00d7 n  (host \u2192 TX FIFO)\n\u2022 POP_RX  \u2192  byte \u00d7 n  (RX FIFO \u2192 host)",
      "originalText": "Host SPI commands (mode 0, MSB first, one command per CS_N-low frame)\n\u2022 WRITE_IMEM  addr, hi, lo  (rejected while running \u2192 ERROR)\n\u2022 READ_IMEM  addr  \u2192  hi, lo\n\u2022 WRITE_REG  reg, value\n\u2022 READ_REG  reg  \u2192  value\n\u2022 PUSH_TX  byte \u00d7 n  (host \u2192 TX FIFO)\n\u2022 POP_RX  \u2192  byte \u00d7 n  (RX FIFO \u2192 host)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
